      "title": "Faculty Jobs@UIowa",
      "description": "Faculty Homepage - Jobs@UIOWA: Search and Apply for Jobs at The University of Iowa Skip to main content The University of Iowa University of Iowa Faculty Jobs@UIowa User Log-in User Log-in Log-in Home Staff Faculty Postdocs Research Interns Grad Assistants Temporary Student Working at Iowa Living in Iowa Faculty Home My Faculty Jobs Search Jobs Faculty Jobs@UIOWA Homepage Home of the world-renowned Iowa Writers’ Workshop and nationally ranked hospitals, the University of Iowa is a\n        comprehensive public university committed to academic excellence, research, and service. As a member of our faculty, you can enjoy a vibrant community and excellent health care in Iowa City, generous\n        retirement benefits, exceptional health insurance, and an institutional commitment to your well-being and success. Iowa is composed of 12 colleges, the largest of which\n        is the College of Liberal Arts and Sciences, enrolling most of our undergraduates. The Henry B. Tippie College of Business, Roy J. and Lucille A. Carver College of Medicine, and the Colleges of\n        Education, Engineering, Law, Nursing, Pharmacy, Public Health, and Dentistry enroll students and collaborate\n        with the Graduate College to support advanced study and research. Iowa offers more than 200 areas of study for\n        undergraduates and more than 100 graduate, doctoral, and professional programs. And as one of the country's foremost public research institutions , new medical\n        treatments and technologies developed by Hawkeyes impact people around the world. You must create a Jobs@UIowa username and password to apply for a faculty position. Once your account is registered, login to begin the application process. Quick Faculty Search Requisition Number: Helpful Links Provost Office Faculty Handbook Dual Career Services Person with Disabilities/Reasonable Accommodations Visit the Colleges Business Liberal Arts and Sciences Dentistry Education Engineering Gr